{"ref":"BDB, רָעֵב","hw":"רָעֵב","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָעֵב</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. be hungry (</strong>NH id. Hiph. and deriv.; Assyrian <em>rûbatu</em>, <em>hunger;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">رَغُبَ</span> <em>be roomy, voracious</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">رَغِبَ</span> <em>desire vehemently;</em> Ethiopic ርኅበ <em>be hungry</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.19\">Is 9:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.12\">44:12</a>; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָעֵ֑בוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:11\" href=\"/Psalms.34.11\">ψ 34:11</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִרְעַב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.21\">Is 8:21</a>, 1 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִרְעֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.14\">Je 42:14</a>, etc.;—<em>be hungry</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.21\">Is 8:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:55\" href=\"/Genesis.41.55\">Gn 41:55</a> (E; of land, = have famine), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.14\">Je 42:14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(לַלֶּחֶם)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.10\">Is 49:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צמא</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.13\">65:13</a> (‖ id.<em>;</em> opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">אכל</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:12\" href=\"/Psalms.50.12\">ψ 50:12</a> <em>if I should be hungry</em> (of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.30\">Pr 6:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.15\">19:15</a>.<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  : <em>allow</em> one <em>to hunger</em>, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>: Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּרְעִבֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.3\">Dt 8:3</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּאֲכִֽלְךָ</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">יַרְעִיב נֶפֶשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.3\">Pr 10:3</a>.","next":"BDB, רָעָב","prev":"BDB, רֵעַ²"}